  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Based Violence Cooperation Across the Nistru River</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The phase II of the project will enhance confidence building between the two banks of the Nistru river in the Republic of Moldova by strengthening the cooperation around gender-based violence issue and testing its potential to become a model of cooperation to support the thematic sub-working groups established as part of the 5+2 settlement process. At the same time, the project will contribute to eliminating barriers for women&#x2019;s active participation as leaders in promoting peace and western values such as human rights and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
